@startuml
title Error Scenario: Invalid Grid File Is Rejected

actor Player
participant "CLI Command Handler" as Command
participant "CLI Grid File I/O" as Files
participant "Game Engine Text Codec" as Codec
participant "File System" as FS
participant "CLI Terminal Presenter" as Presenter

autonumber

Player -> Command: request grid load
Command -> Files: read grid text
Files -> FS: read plain text file
FS --> Files: text that violates the grid format
Files --> Command: grid text
Command -> Codec: parse grid text
Codec --> Command: error: invalid grid format
Command -> Presenter: show clear error message
Presenter --> Player: clear error message

note right of Codec
The Web UI reports the same error when loading a named file from grids/.
end note
@enduml
